<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  
  <!-- SEO & Metatags -->
  <title>Propuesta Comercial // Soporte y Mantenimiento Shopify Premium</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Propuesta de acompañamiento estratégico y soporte técnico para tiendas Shopify. Bolsa de horas flexible adaptada a la gestión constante de catálogo y precios.">
  
  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    /* Variables de Diseño */
    :root {
      --bg-main: #060913;
      --bg-card: rgba(13, 20, 38, 0.65);
      --bg-card-hover: rgba(17, 27, 51, 0.85);
      --border-glow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      --border-active: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
      --accent-primary: #6366f1; /* Indigo */
      --accent-secondary: #06b6d4; /* Cyan */
      --accent-success: #10b981; /* Esmeralda */
      --accent-warning: #f59e0b; /* Ámbar */
      --text-primary: #f8fafc;
      --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
      --radius-lg: 16px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --radius-sm: 8px;
      --font-main: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      --font-heading: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      --shadow-glow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.37);
      --shadow-primary: 0 0 20px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    }

    /* Reset & Estilos Base */
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-main);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
      padding-bottom: 80px;
    }

    /* Scrollbar */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 8px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: var(--bg-main);
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: #1e293b;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
      background: #334155;
    }

    /* Estructura & Layout */
    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    /* Animaciones */
    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes pulseGlow {
      0%, 100% {
        box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
      }
      50% {
        box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
      }
    }

    .animate-fade-in {
      animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease forwards;
    }

    .animate-delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    .animate-delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
    .animate-delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.3s; }

    /* Componentes Generales */
    .glass-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 30px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .badge-primary {
      background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
      color: #818cf8;
      border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
    }

    .badge-secondary {
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
      color: #22d3ee;
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
    }

    .badge-success {
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
      color: #34d399;
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
    }

    /* Botones */
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      border: none;
      font-family: var(--font-main);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-primary), #4f46e5);
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-primary);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }

    /* --- ENCABEZADO --- */
    .header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .logo-container {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .logo-icon {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-primary), var(--accent-secondary));
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-primary);
    }

    .agency-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 30%, var(--accent-secondary));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fillColor: transparent;
    }

    .agency-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .meta-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 16px 20px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto auto;
      gap: 8px 16px;
    }

    .meta-label {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .meta-value {
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: right;
    }

    /* --- INTRODUCCIÓN --- */
    .intro-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .intro-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .title-large {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-secondary), var(--accent-primary));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fillColor: transparent;
    }

    .intro-text {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .intro-bullets {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .bullet-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    }

    /* --- PLANES (TARJETAS) --- */
    .planes-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .planes-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .plan-card {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 30px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .plan-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
    }

    .plan-card.active {
      border-color: var(--accent-primary);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-primary);
      animation: pulseGlow 4s infinite;
    }

    .plan-card.active::before {
      content: '✓ SELECCIONADO';
      position: absolute;
      top: -12px;
      right: 20px;
      background: var(--accent-primary);
      color: white;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .plan-card.popular {
      border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    }

    .plan-card.popular::after {
      content: 'MÁS POPULAR';
      position: absolute;
      top: -12px;
      left: 20px;
      background: var(--accent-secondary);
      color: #000;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .plan-header {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .plan-name {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .plan-hours {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--accent-secondary);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .plan-price {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent-success);
    }

    .plan-price-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-top: -2px;
    }

    .plan-features {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-top: 15px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .plan-features li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .plan-features svg {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    /* --- CALCULADORA & ESTIMADOR --- */
    .calculator-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .calculator-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .section-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .task-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .task-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .task-item:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    }

    .task-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .task-name {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .task-time {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--accent-secondary);
    }

    .counter-controls {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .counter-btn {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
      color: white;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .counter-btn:hover {
      background: var(--accent-primary);
      border-color: var(--accent-primary);
    }

    .counter-value {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      width: 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Panel de Resultados Calculadora */
    .calc-results {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.02);
      border: 1px dashed rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
    }

    .result-block {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .result-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .result-value {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .result-hours {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--accent-secondary);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .slider-group {
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .slider-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .custom-slider {
      width: 100%;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      background: #1e293b;
      outline: none;
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      appearance: none;
    }

    .custom-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb {
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      appearance: none;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent-secondary);
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.5);
      transition: transform 0.1s;
    }

    .custom-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover {
      transform: scale(1.25);
    }

    .recommendation-badge {
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
      color: var(--accent-success);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    /* --- TÉRMINOS & CONDICIONES --- */
    .terms-list {
      list-style-type: decimal;
      padding-left: 20px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    /* --- FIRMA & ACEPTACIÓN --- */
    .sign-section {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-card) 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.02) 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    }

    .sign-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .sign-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .form-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .form-label {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .form-input {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      color: white;
      font-family: var(--font-main);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .form-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent-primary);
    }

    .signature-pad-sim {
      border: 1px dashed var(--border-glow);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      height: 80px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .signature-rendered {
      font-family: 'Outfit', cursive;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: var(--accent-secondary);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      display: none;
    }

    .success-overlay {
      display: none;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 0;
      animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease;
    }

    /* --- BOTONES DE ACCIÓN FLOTANTES --- */
    .actions-bar {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 24px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: rgba(13, 20, 38, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      z-index: 100;
    }

    /* --- ESTILOS DE IMPRESIÓN (PDF) --- */
    @media print {
      body {
        background: #ffffff !important;
        color: #1e293b !important;
        padding-bottom: 0;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 10px;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .actions-bar,
      .counter-controls,
      .slider-group,
      .recommendation-badge,
      .btn,
      .custom-slider {
        display: none !important;
      }

      .glass-card {
        background: #ffffff !important;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0 !important;
        box-shadow: none !important;
        color: #1e293b !important;
        page-break-inside: avoid;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .plan-card {
        background: #ffffff !important;
        border: 1px solid #cbd5e1 !important;
        box-shadow: none !important;
        color: #1e293b !important;
      }

      .plan-card.active {
        border: 2px solid #6366f1 !important;
      }

      .plan-price, .result-value {
        color: #0f172a !important;
      }

      .agency-title {
        background: none !important;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: #0f172a !important;
        color: #0f172a !important;
      }

      .gradient-text {
        background: none !important;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: #4f46e5 !important;
        color: #4f46e5 !important;
      }

      .meta-box {
        background: #f8fafc !important;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0 !important;
      }

      .meta-value {
        color: #0f172a !important;
      }

      .bullet-item {
        background: #f8fafc !important;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0 !important;
        color: #1e293b !important;
      }

      .signature-pad-sim {
        background: #f8fafc !important;
        border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1 !important;
      }

      .signature-rendered {
        display: block !important;
        color: #4f46e5 !important;
      }

      .signature-placeholder-text {
        display: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container animate-fade-in">
    
    <!-- ENCABEZADO -->
    <header class="header">
      <div class="logo-container">
        <div class="logo-icon">🚀</div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="agency-title">AGENCIA DIGITAL</h1>
          <span class="agency-subtitle">Optimización & Soporte Continuo</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="meta-box">
        <span class="meta-label">Propuesta No:</span>
        <span class="meta-value">#SHOPIFY-2026-004</span>
        <span class="meta-label">Cliente:</span>
        <span class="meta-value">Marca Celulares (Shopify)</span>
        <span class="meta-label">Fecha Emisión:</span>
        <span class="meta-value" id="current-date">10/06/2026</span>
        <span class="meta-label">Validez:</span>
        <span class="meta-value">15 Días</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- INTRODUCCIÓN -->
    <section class="glass-card intro-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="badge badge-primary" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Acompañamiento Estratégico</span>
        <h2 class="title-large">Gestión Operativa y<br><span class="gradient-text">Mantenimiento Shopify</span></h2>
        <p class="intro-text">
          Una tienda de celulares exitosa requiere dinamismo. Para delegar la constante actualización de precios, gestión de stock, lanzamientos de nuevos modelos y ajustes técnicos, te proponemos un esquema de <strong>bolsa de horas de soporte flexible</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="intro-text" style="font-size: 0.88rem;">
          Terceriza los cambios técnicos operativos del día a día para que tu equipo se concentre al 100% en la venta y la atención al cliente.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-bullets">
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <span>⚡</span>
          <span>Actualización rápida de precios y stock</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <span>📱</span>
          <span>Carga de nuevos productos y descripciones</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <span>🔧</span>
          <span>Ajustes visuales y optimización de velocidad</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <span>🔗</span>
          <span>Integraciones de pasarelas y apps de venta</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PLANES DE BOLSA DE HORAS -->
    <h3 class="planes-title">Bolsas de Horas Mensuales Sugeridas</h3>
